            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'>\n    SHOW ME: This polars dataframe is used for all visualizations in this \n    notebook. Use the Transform block to interactively process a dataframe with a GUI, \n    no coding required. When you're done, you can copy the code that the GUI \n    generated for you and paste it into your notebook.\n<marimo-ui-element object-id='Kclp-0' random-id='6968b28a-f860-0a8b-0840-a5fb74db7c63'><marimo-dataframe data-initial-value='{&quot;transforms&quot;:[]}' data-label='null' data-columns='[[&quot;County&quot;,&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;],[&quot;Seat&quot;,&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;],[&quot;Established&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u16&quot;],[&quot;Pop&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u32&quot;],[&quot;Pop_Rank&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u32&quot;],[&quot;Area_Sq_Mile&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u16&quot;],[&quot;Area_Sq_KM&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u16&quot;],[&quot;Area_Rank&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u32&quot;],[&quot;Pop_Density_Sq_Mile&quot;,&quot;number&quot;,&quot;f64&quot;],[&quot;Pop_Density_Sq_KM&quot;,&quot;number&quot;,&quot;f64&quot;],[&quot;Pop_Density_Rank&quot;,&quot;integer&quot;,&quot;u32&quot;],[&quot;Formation&quot;,&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;],[&quot;Etymology&quot;,&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;],[&quot;FIPS&quot;,&quot;string&quot;,&quot;str&quot;]]' data-dataframe-name='&quot;df_cal&quot;' data-total='58' data-page-size='5' data-show-download='true' data-download-json-ensure-ascii='true' data-lazy='false'></marimo-dataframe></marimo-ui-element><br><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: flex-start;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0rem'><div><marimo-ui-element object-id='lEQa-0' random-id='0efa800d-12a3-defb-a293-b9dc2baa4e7e'><marimo-radio data-initial-value='&quot;Population&quot;' data-label='null' data-options='[&quot;Population&quot;,&quot;Population Density&quot;,&quot;Area&quot;]' data-inline='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-radio></marimo-ui-element></div></div><br><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: flex-start;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0rem'><div> <h1>California County Population</h1></div></div><br>\n        California\u2019s 58 counties span the widest population extremes of any \n        state in the country. Los Angeles County dominates the high end, while \n        Alpine County anchors the low end, and the spread between them is \n        nearly 10 million people.\n<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style='flex: 1'><marimo-ui-element object-id='Xref-0' random-id='77c105e2-0850-432c-758e-1887889e7e20'><marimo-plotly data-initial-value='{}' data-label='null' data-figure='{&quot;data&quot;:[{&quot;hovertemplate&quot;:&quot;Population=%{x}&#92;u003cbr&#92;u003eCounty=%{y}&#92;u003cextra&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/extra&#92;u003e&quot;,&quot;legendgroup&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;marker&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#636efa&quot;,&quot;pattern&quot;:{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;&quot;}},&quot;name&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;h&quot;,&quot;showlegend&quot;:false,&quot;textposition&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:{&quot;dtype&quot;:&quot;u4&quot;,&quot;bdata&quot;:&quot;wMwPAJbaEQAcshgAFvkYABc2HQDb7yEAFNUmAMMOMABIFTIA1u6TAA==&quot;},&quot;xaxis&quot;:&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;:[&quot;Fresno&quot;,&quot;Contra Costa&quot;,&quot;Sacramento&quot;,&quot;Alameda&quot;,&quot;Santa Clara&quot;,&quot;San Bernardino&quot;,&quot;Riverside&quot;,&quot;Orange&quot;,&quot;San Diego&quot;,&quot;Los Angeles&quot;],&quot;yaxis&quot;:&quot;y&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bar&quot;,&quot;selected&quot;:{&quot;marker&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;green&quot;}}}],&quot;layout&quot;:{&quot